\mathfrak{F}_{\text{SN, MON, POS}} = \{\Phi: \mathbb{R}_{\geq 0}^5 \rightarrow \mathbb{R}_{\geq 0} : \Phi \text{ satisfies N1-N5, N9}\}
}

where:

