\textbf{is the more fundamental unit of economic civilization.}
}

L.4 The Deepest Research Question

\boxed{
\textbf{What is the weakest non-arbitrary principle from which positive} \\
\textbf{economic recognition can be derived?}
}

And subsequently:

\boxed{
\textbf{Can that bridge principle itself be derived from deeper invariants?}
}

